            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201322295?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR corrects some inaccurate text in the documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The original information was incorrect. This update provides the correct content to improve accuracy.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Edited the text<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/201322295/452756068-856b51d9-2dd2-42ed-a2b7-fd5bbb2fe365.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NDkzNzcxODMsIm5iZiI6MTc0OTM3Njg4MywicGF0aCI6Ii8yMDEzMjIyOTUvNDUyNzU2MDY4LTg1NmI1MWQ5LTJkZDItNDJlZC1hMmI3LWZkNWJiYjJmZTM2NS5wbmc_.LWMJpdGoYEpz435wtS8TnHwKZIK6a61Shssm5E2HV5o\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/201322295/452756068-856b51d9-2dd2-42ed-a2b7-fd5bbb2fe365.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NDkzNzcxODMsIm5iZiI6MTc0OTM3Njg4MywicGF0aCI6Ii8yMDEzMjIyOTUvNDUyNzU2MDY4LTg1NmI1MWQ5LTJkZDItNDJlZC1hMmI3LWZkNWJiYjJmZTM2NS5wbmc_.LWMJpdGoYEpz435wtS8TnHwKZIK6a61Shssm5E2HV5o\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-08 151348\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39851.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3127230229\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39851\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39851/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39851\">#39851</a></p>",
