        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add contrast-color() function page.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The feature is in Safari Technology Preview now.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The function is completely different now from the original <code class=\"notranslate\">color-contrast()</code> function. The current version is simple, accepting only one parameter and returning only two possible values.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-5/#contrast-color\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-5/#contrast-color</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://webkit.org/blog/16929/contrast-color/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/blog/16929/contrast-color/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2692770192\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/36973\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/36973/hovercard?comment_id=2939957505&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/36973#issuecomment-2939957505\">#36973 (comment)</a></li>\n</ul>",
