        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/786187?u=ea03cb781b69bbae33dbd354c0902e37ea57a438&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n\n\n\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This documents the Integrity-Policy headers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">I recently added Integrity-Policy to the platform, and I'd like to document it so developers can use it.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-subresource-integrity/#integrity-policy-section\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-subresource-integrity/#integrity-policy-section</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178394056327168\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178394056327168</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2841359435\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/458\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/458/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/458\">WebKit/standards-positions#458</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3084052364\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/45773\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/45773/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/45773\">WebKit/WebKit#45773</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We need to file an equivalent BCD PR that would update the fact that this is shipped in Chromium 138. (It also landed in WebKit ToT, but not yet in an STP)</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #676.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3059881150\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/676\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/676/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/676\">mdn/mdn#676</a></p>",
